From 8b5bb1adb2f163d2dc6bffc5ecbc3e1905faa30a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Orlitzky <michael@orlitzky.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Jun 2021 22:11:41 -0400
Subject: Trac #32037: update libs/lcalc API for lcalc-2.x.

The find_zeros_via_N_v() function was removed from the libLfunction
API in lcalc-2.0.0, and has been replaced by find_zeros(). This commit
updates sage/libs/lcalc/lcalc_Lfunction.pxd with the new function
name, arguments, and return type. The relevant bits can be found in
the lcalc/L.h header.
---
 src/sage/libs/lcalc/lcalc_Lfunction.pxd | 10 +++++-----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

From 3a746e933e8fbaed086d6c9ad991cdf842fd00d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Orlitzky <michael@orlitzky.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Jun 2021 22:23:27 -0400
Subject: Trac #32037: use lcalc-2.x API in libs/lcalc/lcalc_Lfunction.pyx.

Now that we've declared the lcalc-2.x API in our pxd file, this commit
replaces most of the internal uses of find_zeros_via_N_v() with
find_zeros(). The one remaining instance within the Python
find_zeros_via_N() method was left alone, since most of that method
needs to be rewritten anyway.
---
 src/sage/libs/lcalc/lcalc_Lfunction.pyx | 18 +++++++++---------
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

From 6fe69729900068a1dd4f546c2455cb6496343a92 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Orlitzky <michael@orlitzky.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Jun 2021 22:44:04 -0400
Subject: Trac #32037: update find_zeros_via_N() to match the lcalc-2.x API.

Our python find_zeros_via_N() method previously delegated to the C++
find_zeros_via_N_v() method in libLfunction. That method has been
replaced, and the new one has a different set of arguments and some
new behavior. Here we update the arguments and documentation for
find_zeros_via_N() in SageMath to better match the underlying library.

The implementation of find_zeros_via_N() has also been changed, to
more directly call the library API using the arguments passed to
find_zeros_via_N(). It's not clear to me why the previous
incarnation messed around with MPFR so much.
---
 src/sage/libs/lcalc/lcalc_Lfunction.pyx | 35 ++++++++++++++++-----------------
 1 file changed, 17 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

